  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Moroccan Teen Girls Earthquake Relief</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">On September 8 a powerful 6.8 magnitude earthquake hit Morocco, causing a devastating loss of 2000+ lives and significant damage to infrastructures. It is essential to remember that menstruation does not stop during natural disasters, reason why Project Soar has decided to focus every effort on the collection and distribution of menstrual products, diapers &amp; other first aid essential needs to women and girls living in the badly affected villages of the High Atlas region.</narrative>
  </description>
